WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.600
Press reload. The run is gone.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.000
There was nothing to come back to.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.900
And nothing to send anyone.

4
00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.900
Two more features wait on it.

5
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.900
So put it in the address bar.

6
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:19.700
And read it back on load.

7
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.200
Say so while it opens.

8
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:25.700
An empty box reads as nothing here.

9
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.800
A link that points at nothing.

10
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.600
That is the one they kept.

11
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.400
And Back is a button now.

12
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.300
Six ways wrong. Six caught.

13
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.500
A run you can send someone.
